st min-length merging. Segments confined to contiguous NY PRE-to-POST frame. First frame segment is left-truncated; its known prefix is explicit.","target":"Full next-A WLR median within one PRE-through-POST daily frame. Membership is confirmed as soon as next A appears after exactly one B; next A need not finish. Median is scored only after that next A ends causally. Completion8 requires its ending confirmation within next8 bars and before frame end.","warmup":"Consecutive closed M15 history may include NIGHT before PRE; segment A begins inside PRE-to-POST. PRE candle 0 is eligible at its close when history is ready.","coverage":"One earliest eligible closed-bar query per WLR segment throughout PRE/RTH/POST. Include all three colors equally and retain every pending/unfinished sample for prediction. An unfinished next A is a confirmed member without a final median. Unseen third segment at POST end is unconfirmed, not a failed membership label. Pending current sessions remain in a separate prediction ledger with null outcomes and no fabricated losses.","causal":"No final current-A median/end/length in features. Historical labels mature at POST close before the new 16-bar input begins. Match same literal color and decision phase; select at most one candidate per historical day. All intraday test queries are aggregated into paired day means before bootstrap; N queries is not N independent days.","models":"Current known A median, last completed same-color median, all mature color-cohort median delta, original ten-channel STUMPY8/16, then fixed 80% STUMPY squared distance +20% causal cycle-context squared distance. No outcome tuning of weights.","twoStage":"Keep provisional membership predictions for unfinished samples. pMembership is descriptive among resolved historical memberships, with unresolved count and bounds; no unfinished case is relabeled negative. pEvent/pEvent8 separately estimate full median completion inside the frame and within8. Conditional price estimate uses only completed historical targets; >=12 distinct target days, otherwise current-median fallback. One pseudo-count per class; no calibrated-confidence claim.","selection":"Trial selection uses validation price MAE only if >=10 common ready target days, else WAIT/no chosen trial. Keep Jul17 validation and Aug21 final-test boundaries from preceding work. Test metrics are descriptive when selector WAIT.","limits":"Previously inspected archive; this new target has not been forward validated. Variable event timing cannot honestly be drawn as a fixed eight-point price path. No website promotion. Paired circular five-day bootstrap,5000 draws,97.5% intervals; >=30 target days required."},"schema":"wlr-aba-v2","publishedAt":1792587962503,"liveLimit":"Historical scores concern first eligible segment snapshots, including PRE candle 0 using preceding closed history when ready. An already-open segment may be selected for a new causal live forecast; that later entry has not been separately forward validated."}